{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/7/desc","kr_sha":"e2a07adbce64539933418ed5724f4f43c99879fcf0938581933fce15568b240a","zh":"- 罪人說不定指的就是能與我們所尋找的金枝產生共鳴的人。\n- 一旦靠近這些金枝，與其共鳴之罪人的「自我心道」便會展現，我們就得以從中體驗他們的過往，又或窺探他們的心靈。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/7/id","kr_sha":"442697675af5a7c4732c5f6512eb1be1ee9dfd83c9dee115686852aa01a4acd1","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_8","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/7/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/8/desc","kr_sha":"4e1e0895a0807f5597a27a6a5f9bba2ddf7a13b18e05695387a48226e80a3155","zh":"- 似乎是用來特指都市中的各個核心區域。\n- 都市被分為許多區塊，但是每個區塊好像總是會被分為巢和後巷。\n- 巢實際上是受到被稱為區塊實控人的大型企業——翼，其管理與保護的區域。而後巷貌似沒有這麼大的影響力。或許吧？\n- 我曾經問了一下維吉里烏斯，自己是來自巢還是後巷，但他沒理我。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/8/id","kr_sha":"3fcac16607770da640fd27ef2053f4a9f81718f43d8b32564c35712dbccdd5ff","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_9","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
