{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/11/desc","kr_sha":"1bcd96f82e706ffaf91b48dcaa0573af81f4e64af2d4945baa618564804505d8","zh":"- 據一名我們在銀鳳炸雞酒吧遇到的、名為三朝的員工所述，奇點技術似乎在食品相關的科技研發上也有應用。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
