{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/12/desc","kr_sha":"30ee29d893c9be8c1e83b6efc351d4152ca1cb9bfc668d85c914de07b805339a","zh":"- 腦葉公司。\n- 已折斷的翼，目前翼席空缺。其巢位於12區。\n都市裡人盡皆知的（是只有我不知道，還是屬於我丟失記憶中的一部分……？）白夜黑晝事件的中心區域。\n我們所搜尋的留有金枝的分部，似乎全都曾屬於舊L公司。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail.json|/dataList/12/id","kr_sha":"7770e1b40ae3923f999a3ce5c95692278faa7650e60c3ef1e13ea2b3bbeb0a40","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_13","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
